<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Hi {!Contact.Name},</span><br><br>Account: {!EBS_Order__c.Account_Name__c}</font><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Purchase Order:&nbsp;{!EBS_Order_Line__c.Purchase_Order__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Sales Order:&nbsp;{!EBS_Order_Line__c.Sales_Order__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Ship Date:&nbsp;{!EBS_Order_Line__c.Scheduled_Ship_Date_only__c}</font></div><div><font style="font-size: 12pt;"><br><a href="https://kooziegroup--full--c.documentforce.com/email/templaterenderer?id=00X53000000DzTB&amp;base_href=https%3A%2F%2Fkooziegroup--full.my.salesforce.com&amp;preview_frame=previewFrame&amp;render_type=REPLACED_HTML_BODY&amp;setupid=CommunicationTemplatesEmail" style="text-decoration-line: none; color: rgb(69, 111, 178);"></a></font><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello! One or more (if applicable) items on your order have shipped. To view tracking and all order details, use this link:&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><font color="#2f5496" face="arial"><b><u>{!EBS_Order__c.Tracking_Link_NoPricing__c}</u></b></font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font color="#2f5496" face="arial"><b><u><br></u></b></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN-US">If the link doesn’t work, copy and paste the above URL into your browser:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><a><span lang="EN-US">Please share your feedback on your order experience with us by completing&nbsp;</span></a><a></a><a></a><span lang="EN-US"><a>this survey:&nbsp;&nbsp;</a><a href="https://kooziegroup.surveymonkey.com/r/2ZYRTX2">Feedback</a></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN-US"><br>Thank you for your order! If you have any questions regarding this order, please reply to this email.</span></p></div><div><p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></span></p><div><div id="_com_1" class="msocomtxt" language="JavaScript"><p class="MsoCommentText"><br></p></div></div><p style="font-size: medium; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">All the best,<br>Calendar Coop&nbsp;<span style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;;">Customer Support</span></p><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
